THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This project bundles and depends on third-party open-source software. Their
licences are recorded in docs/OPEN_SOURCE_LICENSES.md and, where the component
ships a licence file, under static/vendor/.

EXTERNAL DATA SERVICES

Weather and marine data are retrieved from Open-Meteo.com. The data is licensed
CC BY 4.0 and attribution is displayed in the application footer. Open-Meteo's
free hosted API tier is offered for non-commercial use; commercial deployments
must either subscribe to a paid Open-Meteo plan, self-host Open-Meteo (AGPLv3),
or switch the provider to met.no by setting SURF_COMMERCIAL_MODE=True.

AI MODELS

